  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Summary:<br><br>Welcome to Seas the Day!<br><br><br><br>Escape to your own coastal sanctuary along scenic 30A in Seacrest Beach right between Rosemary Beach and Alys Beach. This stunning 3-story beach home with an elevator features 4 bedrooms plus a bonus bunk room. With dual master suites, a dedicated bunk bedroom, and an additional bonus room with bunks, the home comfortably sleeps up to 16 guests—perfect for multi-generational families, large groups, or a friends’ getaway.<br><br><br><br>The Space:<br><br>✨ Highlights You’ll Love<br><br>3-Story Home with Elevator – Perfect for all ages <br><br>4 Bedrooms + Bonus Bunk Room – Dual masters + 2 bunk spaces<br><br>Sleeps 16 – Ideal for multi-generational families & large groups<br><br>Private Seacrest Beach Access with first-class shuttle service<br><br>4 Complimentary Bikes – Explore 30A in style<br><br>Community Pool Access just steps away<br><br>Gated Community – Added privacy and security<br><br>Easy Highway 98 Access – Avoid the 30A traffic<br><br>Outdoor Grill for family cookouts<br><br><br><br>🚐 First-Class Shuttle Service<br><br>Our shuttle picks you up right at the house and takes you to:<br><br>- Private Seacrest Beach Access<br><br>- Inlet Beach Public Access<br><br>- Rosemary Beach Town Square<br><br>- 30Avenue – Upscale shopping, dining, and entertainment<br><br><br><br>🏖 The Space<br><br>This home was designed with multi-generational comfort in mind. Two master suites provide private retreats for adults, while the bunk and bonus bunk rooms give kids and teens their own space to unwind.<br><br><br><br>Sleeping Arrangements:<br><br>Bedroom 1 – King (Master) (sleeps 2)<br><br>Bedroom 2 – King (Master) (sleeps 2)<br><br>Bedroom 3 – Queen (sleeps 2)<br><br>Bedroom 4 – 2 Queens with Twin XL bunks above (sleeps 6)<br><br>Kids Bunk Zone (w/ 2nd living room) – 2 sets of Twin XL bunks (sleeps 4)<br><br><br><br>Included Amenities:<br><br>- Elevator for effortless access to all 3 floors<br><br>- 4 Bikes for exploring 30A<br><br>- Smart TVs in every room (Netflix, Hulu, YouTubeTV & more)<br><br>- Complimentary Wi-Fi<br><br>- Coffee Bar - Drip + Keurig<br><br>- Full Linen Package & Washer/Dryer<br><br>- Fully stocked kitchen for easy family meals<br><br>- Outdoor grill<br><br><br><br>🚗 Parking<br><br>3 dedicated parking spots<br><br>Overflow parking less than 1 mile away<br><br><br><br>📍 About the Area<br><br>Nestled between Alys Beach and Rosemary Beach, Seas the Day offers the perfect balance of privacy and convenience. Guests enjoy private Seacrest Beach access, a community pool, and a shuttle service that makes exploring 30A effortless. Quick Highway 98 access makes day trips to nearby attractions simple—without getting caught in 30A traffic.<br><br><br><br>✅ Additional Details<br><br>- Must be 25+ to book and be present for entire stay<br><br>- No pets<br><br>- No parties<br><br>- Rental agreement + $100 incidental hold required<br><br><br><br>Whether you’re planning a sun-soaked summer escape or a cozy fall getaway with firepit nights and family cookouts, Seas the Day is your perfect 30A retreat. Book now and start making memories!<br><br><br><br>Guest Access:<br><br>Guest will have access to the entire home. Guidebook will receive a digital guidebook about the home and local area.<br><br><br><br>Getting Around:<br><br>Walk, bike or take the shuttle service that picks you up right at your front door!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
